   "cer:reviewStatus": "needs_review",
   "cer:sourceText": "patients with the following cardiovascular and cerebrovascular diseases within 6 months: myocardial infarction, unstable angina, coronary revascularization/angioplasty, coronary artery bypass grafting, coronary artery stenting, New York Heart Association (NYHA) class ≥ 2 cardiac insufficiency, severe unstable arrhythmia, deep vein thrombosis, pulmonary embolism history, active cerebral infarction, active cerebral hemorrhage;",
