   "cer:sourceText": "Extensive radiation pneumonitis, pulmonary embolism or active massive hemoptysis; Patients with severe gastrointestinal diseases or gastrointestinal disorders (such as gastrointestinal bleeding, gastrointestinal obstruction, unhealed peptic ulcer, immune enteritis, ulcerative colitis, Crohn's disease, ischemic necrotizing enteritis, diarrhea > grade 1, other gastrointestinal diseases that may affect the tolerance of chemotherapy) at screening;",
