   "cer:sourceText": "Patients with brain metastasis at baseline should meet all the following conditions: lesions not involving the brainstem, the number of brain metastases ≤ 2 (but patients with only intracranial target lesions should be excluded), imaging stability for at least 3 weeks after local treatment control, and no application of dehydration drugs and hormones before screening,Without any symptoms of brain metastasis;",
